    "event_id": "EV-a1da145cb3f6b8ba",
    "subject": "Google DeepMind 新负责人：Gemini 4 已进入打磨阶段，将远早于年底",
    "predicate": "product_release",
    "object": "“Our intention is to, like — as soon as possible — to release an early post-training output because we see the results and we are excited,” Kavukcuoglu told the publication, adding that Google would “continue the fast-paced iterations” going forward. This hopefully marks Google returning to a more consistent AI release timeline following a shakeup at DeepMind’s top leadership, with former AI head Demis Hassabis stepping down in August after announcing that “ great progress ” was being made on Gemini 4.",
